        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Vertigo and dizziness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sudden onset room-spinning vertigo, worse with head movement, with nausea and vomiting. Now markedly improved; no further vomiting. Still has brief dizziness with quick head turns and getting out of bed. No vertigo at rest."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported neurologic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies diplopia, dysarthria, limb weakness or numbness, gait collapse, and new severe headache."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Ear symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Intermittent left tinnitus during the last week and left ear felt a little blocked; mostly settled now. Possible mild left-sided muffled hearing when symptoms were acute, now described as pretty normal. No current otalgia or ear discharge."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
